turret, the last line of defense against the alien horde. No backup. No retreat. Just firepower, grit, and the promise of a well-earned plate of 'omurice' awaiting her return.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your turret!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build frontline generators!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge the superweapon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast alien scum back to whatever hell they crawled out of!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/fe3064002597916ddec6bfc8409d0df8.poster.avif?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/fe3064002597916ddec6bfc8409d0df8.webm?t=1769141114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/fe3064002597916ddec6bfc8409d0df8.mp4?t=1769141114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/345fe417198e59ee483c99956dbee4df.avif?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/72010856d594d6b2a86a0d49c2f467b7.webp?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=22 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, lock on, and blast away! Our <strong>on-rails turret platform</strong> provides unparalleled <strong>versatility</strong> and <strong>top-tier alien-annihilating firepower</strong>\u2014so even the greenest recruit can rack up confirmed kills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/dab91c799e3488275f15ce1be3c1d8f8.webp?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=22 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is always changing, and so are you! <strong>Every mission completed, every alien fried</strong> means more resources to upgrade your <strong>defenses, power generation, and devastating firepower</strong>! Perform well, and you\u2019ll earn the best tech humanity has to offer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/51e142de3b3a1da2813a1173f71c854b.webp?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=22 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uniform is <strong>battle-tested, stress-resistant, and strategically disposable</strong>! Under extreme conditions, it will <strong>self-disintegrate</strong> to ensure <strong>maximum survivability </strong>and <strong>maneuverability</strong>. Who needs dignity when you can have victory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/4471e071adf4b6a918fec9f4ed863bc6.webp?t=1769141114\" width=616 height=22 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your stripes! High-ranking troopers are <strong>rewarded with fresh underwear, elite accessories, and upgraded turret systems</strong>! Fight harder, score higher, and <strong>earn the best gear</strong>\u2014because winners don\u2019t wear rags!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029750/extras/4